ttps://ci-en.dlsite.com/creator/3586\" target=\"_blank\">https://ci-en.dlsite.com/creator/3586</a>", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ190000/RJ189264/f857133ae97422b6e5da9e8b92f77eca.jpg", "alt": "あずにゃんとにゃんにゃん! [えるるっく]", "title": "あずにゃんとにゃんにゃん! [えるるっく]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "えるるっくの公式HPはこちら!<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.llook.info/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.llook.info/</a>"}]}], "description": "あずにゃんとにゃんにゃんするげーむ", "short_introduction": "あずにゃんとにゃんにゃんするげーむ", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ189264.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794965312}